Location: Could be used for central European conditions
Technology: Efficiency of boiler of average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c6d24609-ca75-30cf-b88b-0ec2bbca5643.xml</text>
